  nonce: d7a0  # d7a0
  message: "SATISFIED. Fixed in PR #1576 (merge 1997a56d0d), folded into scheme v9 (unreleased; no v10). Follow-up PR #1577 (merge 4d5a8ec889: Perl block packages, SPARQL query ordinals) and docs PR #1578 (e315bcb5b9).\nROOT CAUSE: the doc/template producers minted make_doc_stable_id / make_doc_symbol_ids with no scope (markdown, rst, scss, puppet, svelte), apex hashed no enclosing type, fish no enclosing function; the gate passed because two-parent fixtures existed for some languages only.\nFIX: every listed producer hashes the full parent chain through the shared helpers (ancestor_labels + make_doc_stable_id(scope=), scoped_stable_id, scoped_table_stable_id, nested_qualified_name / nested_member_qualified_name; new base.html_element_tag and base.block_prelude labels, c_family_scope_chain(functions=, types=)). Markdown: section nesting; rst: hierarchy from adornment order (meta.level now real); scss/puppet: rules, classes, branches; svelte/astro: element + block chain; apex: type chain; fish: function chain. Ten more producers found by the new fixtures and fixed: astro, blade, C block scopes, CMake functions, gnuplot blocks, HLSL namespaces/functions, JSON + Cargo dependency groups, TOML 3-part table names, Meson branches, asm local labels; else-without-if labels (CMake, Meson, gnuplot); Maven groupId. Mermaid verdict: a node id in two subgraphs is ONE Mermaid node (documented same-scope tie, not a two-parent case); the same id in two diagrams keeps its id.\nGUARD: test_stable_id_floor_gate.test_every_language_has_a_two_parent_fixture_or_is_flat (SiblingCase.nested: one text under two parents; FLAT_LANGUAGES with reasons, stale-checked) + test_every_registered_language_has_a_fixture. Red on dev 5d7fb73fb2 (17 languages MISSING, 18 deletion regressions), green on the PR.\nEVIDENCE (merged dev 1997a56d0d, `hypergumbo run --include-docs`, first parent blanked, survivors matched by (kind,name,line,col)): this item's own repro (f3/live/docprobe.py + sweep2.py): markdown 3/3, rst 2/2, scss 3/3, puppet 2/2, svelte 2/2, apex 4/4, fish 2/2 same, 0 moved/null; mermaid subgraph 1 moved (one node, accepted tie), mermaid two diagrams 3/3 same; perl block packages 2/2 same on 4d5a8ec889 (sweep2 TOTAL 40 same, 1 moved = the mermaid tie; docprobe 19/19). All 96 two-parent / else / maven gate fixtures through the CLI: 365/365 same, 0 moved, 0 null, 0 unmatched. Corpus on 4d5a8ec889 (code 24,670 / config 5,903 / extra 1,322 nodes): floor_cohort 0, floor_abstained 0, none 0, collisions 0, checkout-location 0 differing positions."  # d7a0
